:"பெறாஅது","parts":[{"text":"பெறாஅது","lemma":"பெறாஅது","gloss":"not obtaining"}],"gloss":"not obtaining","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"விளியும்","parts":[{"text":"விளி","lemma":"viḷi","gloss":"perish"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"will"}],"gloss":"will perish"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புன்தலைப்","parts":[{"text":"புன்தலைப்","lemma":"புன்தலைப்","gloss":"miserable-headed"}],"gloss":"miserable-headed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெரும்பாழ்","parts":[{"text":"பெரும்பாழ்","lemma":"பெரும்பாழ்","gloss":"great desolation"}],"gloss":"great desolation","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செயும்","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"cey","gloss":"do/make"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"will"}],"gloss":"will cause"},{"surface":"இவள்","parts":[{"text":"இவள்","lemma":"ivaḷ","gloss":"she/her"}],"gloss":"this woman's"},{"surface":"நலனே","parts":[{"text":"நலன்","lemma":"nalaṉ","gloss":"beauty/goodness"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"beauty indeed"}]}],"literal":"Born ... [or of another family], because of feeding milk, saying [it is milk] / the mother who gave birth indeed is not one who refuses [the alliance] / the young son of a strong warrior who says \"what is education?\" / is a good man with a bright spear, and that being so / while those who perished die, the relatives of those who survived / not obtaining protectors, will perish, / this woman's beauty will cause a great desolation of dusty-headed ruin.","translation":"Whether she is born in this family or another, since she was fed milk, her mother who gave birth to her does not refuse her hand. The young son of the strong warrior, who asks 'What is education?' and wields a bright spear, is a capable man. Since that is so, while those who fought and perished are gone, the surviving relatives of the dead, finding no protectors, will also perish. This woman's beauty will cause a great, dusty-headed desolation.","modern":"இவள் இந்தக்குடியில் பிறந்தவளோ அல்லது வேறு குடியைச் சேர்ந்தவளோ, இவளுக்குப் பாலூட்டி வளர்த்ததால் இவளைப் பெற்ற தாய் இவளது திருமணத்தை மறுப்பவள் அல்லள். 'கல்வி என்றால் என்ன?' என்று கேட்கும் வலிமைமிக்க வீரனின் இளமகன், ஒளிரும் வேலை ஏந்திய நல்ல வீரன் ஆவான். நிலைமை இவ்வாறிருக்க, போரில் அழிந்தவர்கள் அழிய, எஞ்சியிருக்கும் சுற்றத்தாரோ தங்களைக் காப்பாரைப் பெறாமல் அழிந்து போவர். இவளுடைய அழகு, புழுதி படிந்த பெரும் பாழடைதலை உண்டாக்கும்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Makaṭpāṟ Kāñci theme, where a conflict arises because a girl's hand in marriage is refused to a powerful suitor. An onlooker or mediator describes the impending tragedy of the town. The mother of the girl does not object to the marriage, having raised her with care. The suitor is a fierce young warrior who disdains peaceful education and relies solely on his bright spear. Because of the pride and refusal of the girl's father or clan, a devastating war is inevitable. In this war, the warriors will perish, and their surviving relatives, left without protectors, will also die, turning the settlement into a dusty, ruined desolation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.42],[0.42,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.25],[1.25,1.98],[1.98,2.4],[2.4,2.8],[2.8,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.5,4.8],[4.8,5.1],[5.1,5.5],[5.5,6.1],[6.4,6.6],[6.7,7.0],[7.0,7.46],[7.54,7.8],[7.8,8.9],[8.9,9.08],[9.12,9.26],[9.26,9.83],[9.83,10.55],[10.55,11.13],[11.13,11.7],[11.7,12.97],[12.97,13.5],[13.5,13.8],[13.8,14.1],[14.1,14.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.1,1.37],[1.37,2.19],[2.19,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.6],[3.6,3.8],[3.8,5.3],[5.3,5.6],[5.6,6.4],[6.4,6.6],[6.6,7.0],[7.0,7.5],[7.5,8.0],[8.0,9.0],[9.0,10.1],[10.1,10.23],[10.27,10.99],[10.99,11.57],[11.57,12.3],[12.3,12.9],[12.9,13.52],[13.52,14.3],[14.3,15.0],[15.0,15.3],[15.3,15.6],[15.6,16.0]]},"sync":[[["பிற","other/born"]],[["ள","she/her/suffix"]],[["பால்","milk"]],[["என","as/saying"]],[["மடுத்தலின்","because of feeding"]],[["ஈன்ற","who gave birth to"]],[["தாயோ","mother indeed"]],[["வேண்டாள்","she does not refuse"]],[["அல்லள்","she is not"]],[["கல்வியென்","what is education?"]],[["என்னும்","who says"]],[["வல்லாண்","strong warrior"]],[["சிறாஅன்","young man"]],[["ஒள்வேல்","bright spear"]],[["நல்லன்","capable man"]],[["அதுவாய்","that being so"]],[["ஆகுதல்","becoming"]],[["அழிந்தோர்","those who perished"]],[["அழிய","while perishing"]],[["ஒழிந்தோர்","those who survived"]],[["ஒக்கல்","relatives"]],[["பேணுநர்ப்","protectors"]],[["பெறாஅது","not obtaining"]],[["விளியும்","will perish"]],[["புன்தலைப்","miserable-headed"]],[["பெரும்பாழ்","great desolation"]],[["செயும்","will cause"]],[["இவள்","this woman's"]],[["நலனே","beauty indeed"]]]}